1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,390
M: Excuse me, but I'd like to exchange this shirt I bought last night.

2
00:00:03,855 --> 00:00:04,490
W1: Of course, sir.

3
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,770
Do you mind my asking what the problem is?

4
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:08,095
M: Not at all.

5
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:12,550
When I arrived home and took it out of the packaging, I noticed this huge tear in it.

6
00:00:13,265 --> 00:00:15,330
W1: Wow, I'm terribly sorry about that.

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:19,070
You're free to exchange it for anything of equal or lesser value here.

8
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:20,970
May I see your receipt, please?

9
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,715
M: I didn't realize you were going to request it.

10
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,430
W2: You can let him exchange it, Danielle.

11
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:29,920
I sold him the item yesterday, so I can confirm he bought it here.

12
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,455
M: Thanks for your assistance.
